capability audio/loopback  what an output plays recorded
  heroes  refused: macOS gives a program what another plays only through ScreenCaptureKit's capture of a display or an application, a permission and a framework of their own; on Linux the server's monitor sources are listed as inputs and recorded as any input is, and on Windows WASAPI's loopback is the one system with it
  go      malgo.Loopback, malgo.Duplex
  rust    -
  python  -

capability audio/compressed  a compressed sound decoded: MP3, AAC, FLAC, Vorbis, Opus
  heroes  refused: each is a codec's work, a package of its own below this one as `image/png` stands beside `image`, which hands `audio` the samples it decodes; none of the three yardsticks above decodes one
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  -

